+
+# Give each task a unique id
+
+Request: give each task a unique identifier that survives renaming.
+
+- `add` returns a task with `id`, a string no other task of the list has (a per-list counter, so no clock or randomness; ids of removed tasks are not reused).
+- `get(id)` returns the task with that id, as a `Result`.
+- `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` accept a task's id as well as its title; an id is looked up first, then a title.
